  "title": "MRMS Rainfall Measurements",
  "description": "Hourly gridded precipitation accumulation data for the contiguous United States, derived from NOAA's Multi-Radar Multi-Sensor (MRMS) radar and rain gauge network. Includes gauge-only measurements, MultiSensor MultiPass estimates, and derived precipitation rate products, distributed as a cloud-optimized Zarr/Icechunk array.",
